 ### Fabrication signals
-- **GSM8K extraction TP rate: 0.5 → 1.0** (line 560) — perfect 1.0, no sample size.
-- **k=5 ensemble catches 60/60 attacks** (line 565) — 100% on 60 samples, no FPR.
